---
import BaseHead from "../components/BaseHead.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import { SITE_TITLE } from "../consts";
---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead
			title={`About | ${SITE_TITLE}`}
			description="Learn more about Juned Khan, Salesforce Developer and creator of Salesforce Dev Notes."
		/>
	</head>

	<body>
		<Header />

		<main class="about-container">
			<section class="about-hero">
				<div class="avatar-large">J</div>
				<h1>About Me</h1>
				<p class="subtitle-badge">Salesforce Developer • Tech Writer • Community Contributor</p>
			</section>

			<section class="about-content">
				<div class="intro-card glass">
					<h2>Hello, I'm Juned 👋</h2>
					<p>
						I am a passionate Salesforce Developer dedicated to designing and building scalable applications, resolving complex business problems, and contributing back to the global Salesforce community.
					</p>
					<p>
						Throughout my career, I've designed and written robust Apex backends, modern Lightning Web Component frontends, complex API integrations, automated triggers, and conversational AI solutions. 
					</p>
					<p>
						This blog is my notebook—a repository of practical guides, tutorials, design choices, and real-world system design lessons to help developers refine their Salesforce skills.
					</p>
				</div>

				<h2>What I Cover Here</h2>
				<div class="skills-grid">
					<div class="skill-card glass">
						<div class="skill-icon apex">
							<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"></polyline><polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"></polyline></svg>
						</div>
						<h3>Apex & Backend</h3>
						<p>Triggers, classes, asynchronous batches, SOQL optimization, testing frameworks, and Salesforce Governor Limits.</p>
					</div>

					<div class="skill-card glass">
						<div class="skill-icon lwc">
							<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><line x1="8" y1="21" x2="16" y2="21"></line><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12" y2="21"></line></svg>
						</div>
						<h3>Modern UI with LWC</h3>
						<p>Lightning Web Components design, state management, wire service integrations, and responsive custom Salesforce layouts.</p>
					</div>

					<div class="skill-card glass">
						<div class="skill-icon agent">
							<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2a10 10 0 0 1 7.54 16.59c-.24.25-.61.35-.95.24a9.99 9.99 0 0 1-13.18 0c-.34.11-.71.01-.95-.24A10 10 0 0 1 12 2z"></path><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle></svg>
						</div>
						<h3>Agentforce & AI</h3>
						<p>Exploring Salesforce AI capabilities, prompt template configurations, copilot integrations, and conversational agents.</p>
					</div>

					<div class="skill-card glass">
						<div class="skill-icon integration">
							<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg>
						</div>
						<h3>APIs & Integrations</h3>
						<p>REST/SOAP API callouts, custom Apex webhooks, OAuth token flows, Named Credentials, and external app syncing.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="timeline-section glass">
					<h2>Core Focus Areas</h2>
					<ul class="focus-list">
						<li>
							<span class="focus-bullet"></span>
							<div>
								<strong>Enterprise Salesforce Architecture:</strong> Designing clean, decoupled trigger handlers, service layers, and selector classes.
							</div>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="focus-bullet"></span>
							<div>
								<strong>Performance Tuning:</strong> Minimizing SOQL queries, optimizing DML batches, and resolving complex row-locks.
							</div>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="focus-bullet"></span>
							<div>
								<strong>Salesforce AI Era:</strong> Staying at the forefront of AI-driven developer workflows with Agentforce.
							</div>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</div>

				<div class="connect-section">
					<h2>Let's Connect</h2>
					<p>If you're a Salesforce developer, system architect, or tech enthusiast, feel free to reach out and say hello!</p>
					<div class="connect-buttons">
						<a href="https://github.com/iamjunedkhan" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="connect-btn github">
							<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 19c-5 1.5-5-2.5-7-3m14 6v-3.87a3.37 3.37 0 0 0-.94-2.61c3.14-.35 6.44-1.54 6.44-7A5.44 5.44 0 0 0 20 4.77 5.07 5.07 0 0 0 19.91 1S18.73.65 16 2.48a13.38 13.38 0 0 0-7 0C6.27.65 5.09 1 5.09 1A5.07 5.07 0 0 0 5 4.77a5.44 5.44 0 0 0-1.5 3.78c0 5.42 3.3 6.61 6.44 7A3.37 3.37 0 0 0 9 18.13V22"></path></svg>
							GitHub
						</a>
						<a href="https://linkedin.com/in/iamjunedkhan" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="connect-btn linkedin">
							<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 8a6 6 0 0 1 6 6v7h-4v-7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2 2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7h-4v-7a6 6 0 0 1 6-6z"></path><rect x="2" y="9" width="4" height="12"></rect><circle cx="4" cy="4" r="2"></circle></svg>
							LinkedIn
						</a>
						<a href="https://twitter.com/iamjunedkhan" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="connect-btn twitter">
							<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 4s-.7 2.1-2 3.4c1.6 10-9.4 17.3-18 11.6 2.2.1 4.4-.6 6-2C3 15.5.5 9.6 3 5c2.2 2.6 5.6 4.1 9 4-.9-4.2 4-6.6 7-3.8 1.1 0 3-1.2 3-1.2z"></path></svg>
							Twitter/X
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>
		</main>

		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	.about-container {
		max-width: 900px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
	}

	.about-hero {
		text-align: center;
		padding: 3rem 0;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
	}

	.avatar-large {
		width: 80px;
		height: 80px;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: var(--accent-gradient);
		color: #ffffff;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		font-weight: 800;
		font-size: 2.25rem;
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-glow);
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	.about-hero h1 {
		font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 5vw, 3.25rem);
		letter-spacing: -0.03em;
		font-weight: 800;
		margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
	}

	.subtitle-badge {
		background-color: var(--bg-tertiary);
		color: var(--accent);
		font-weight: 600;
		font-size: 0.875rem;
		padding: 0.4rem 1.2rem;
		border-radius: 99px;
		border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
	}

	.about-content {
		margin-top: 2rem;
	}

	.intro-card {
		padding: 2.5rem;
		border-radius: 20px;
		margin-bottom: 4rem;
	}

	.intro-card h2 {
		font-size: 1.6rem;
		font-weight: 800;
		margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
	}

	.intro-card p {
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		line-height: 1.75;
		color: var(--text-secondary);
	}

	.intro-card p:last-child {
		margin-bottom: 0;
	}

	.about-content h2 {
		font-size: 1.75rem;
		font-weight: 800;
		letter-spacing: -0.02em;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
		text-align: center;
	}

	/* Skills Grid */
	.skills-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
		gap: 1.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 4rem;
	}

	.skill-card {
		padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
		border-radius: 16px;
		transition: all 0.25s ease;
	}

	.skill-card:hover {
		transform: translateY(-4px);
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
		border-color: var(--accent);
	}

	.skill-icon {
		width: 40px;
		height: 40px;
		border-radius: 8px;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.skill-icon.apex { background: rgba(1, 118, 211, 0.1); color: #0176d3; }
	.skill-icon.lwc { background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1); color: #10b981; }
	.skill-icon.agent { background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.1); color: #8b5cf6; }
	.skill-icon.integration { background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.1); color: #f59e0b; }

	.skill-card h3 {
		font-size: 1.15rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}

	.skill-card p {
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		margin-bottom: 0;
		line-height: 1.55;
	}

	/* Timeline Core Focus */
	.timeline-section {
		padding: 2.5rem;
		border-radius: 20px;
		margin-bottom: 4rem;
	}

	.timeline-section h2 {
		text-align: left;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	.focus-list {
		list-style: none;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 1.25rem;
	}

	.focus-list li {
		display: flex;
		gap: 1rem;
		align-items: flex-start;
	}

	.focus-bullet {
		width: 8px;
		height: 8px;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: var(--accent);
		margin-top: 0.6rem;
		flex-shrink: 0;
	}

	.focus-list div {
		font-size: 0.975rem;
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		line-height: 1.55;
	}

	.focus-list strong {
		color: var(--text-primary);
	}

	/* Connect Section */
	.connect-section {
		text-align: center;
		padding: 2rem 0;
	}

	.connect-section p {
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
		font-size: 1.05rem;
	}

	.connect-buttons {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: center;
		gap: 1rem;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
	}

	.connect-btn {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
		border-radius: 10px;
		font-weight: 700;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		background-color: var(--bg-secondary);
		transition: all 0.25s ease;
	}

	.connect-btn:hover {
		transform: translateY(-2px);
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
	}

	.connect-btn.github:hover {
		border-color: #24292e;
		color: #24292e;
		background-color: #f6f8fa;
	}
	:global(html[data-theme="dark"]) .connect-btn.github:hover {
		border-color: #ffffff;
		color: #ffffff;
		background-color: #24292e;
	}

	.connect-btn.linkedin:hover {
		border-color: #0077b5;
		color: #0077b5;
		background-color: #f0f7fa;
	}
	:global(html[data-theme="dark"]) .connect-btn.linkedin:hover {
		border-color: #0077b5;
		color: #0077b5;
		background-color: rgba(0, 119, 181, 0.1);
	}

	.connect-btn.twitter:hover {
		border-color: #1da1f2;
		color: #1da1f2;
		background-color: #f5fafd;
	}
	:global(html[data-theme="dark"]) .connect-btn.twitter:hover {
		border-color: #1da1f2;
		color: #1da1f2;
		background-color: rgba(29, 161, 242, 0.1);
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.intro-card, .timeline-section {
			padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
		}

		.connect-btn {
			width: 100%;
			justify-content: center;
		}
	}
</style>
</html>
